Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:02.812
PRIYANKA VERGADIA: Cat-Out has
concluded that their packaging

00:00:02.812 --> 00:00:06.120
subscriber is going to receive
a large number of messages.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:10.038
Stay tuned to find out when
and how using pub subscribers.

00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:12.528
